  "asset.logo.concept": "OM is read as a pair, not as a word: O is the opening, M is the mass. Architecture is the negotiation between what is cut away and what is left standing, and in an existing building that negotiation is the whole job. The mark is a square aperture \u2014 a threshold seen in plan \u2014 constructed on the same module the sheets are set on. It is a fragment of a drawing rather than a picture of a building.",
